{
  "id": "askZaioRagFlow01",
  "name": "Ask the Zaio assistant",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 1 · Ask\nThe student types a question into an n8n form. **Settings** holds the two things you may need to change: where the RAG API runs, and (optionally) a Discord webhook for questions the assistant can't answer.\n\nn8n in Docker: keep `host.docker.internal`. n8n installed with npm: use `http://localhost:8000`.",
        "height": 460,
        "width": 620,
        "color": 7
      },
      "id": "ef871250-8243-4baf-9ae6-01b2049a0ea7",
      "name": "Note: Ask",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -80,
        -40
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 2 · Call the RAG API\n`POST /ask` with `{\"question\": ...}`. The reply is `{answer, source}`, and `source` is `null` when the answer isn't in the handbook or on zaio.io.\n\nThe timeout is 5 minutes because the free local model can take a minute on a slow laptop.",
        "height": 460,
        "width": 560,
        "color": 4
      },
      "id": "012b8f97-7943-47fe-b009-67a4c0e295d3",
      "name": "Note: API",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        580,
        -40
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 3 · Reply\n**answered** → the answer and its source.\n**not found** → the question goes to the tutors' Discord channel (if a webhook is set) so someone can follow up, then the student is told.\n**error** → a friendly message. The technical reason (API down, index not built...) stays in the execution log, in the output of **Read the reply**.",
        "height": 840,
        "width": 920,
        "color": 6
      },
      "id": "b5e7414b-f9cd-401b-9f2b-bfb19e28f7a4",
      "name": "Note: Reply",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        1180,
        -200
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "formTitle": "Ask the Zaio assistant",
        "formDescription": "Ask anything about the bootcamp handbook or the courses on zaio.io. Answers come only from those two sources, with a link to where they came from.",
        "formFields": {
          "values": [
            {
              "fieldLabel": "Question",
              "fieldType": "textarea",
              "placeholder": "e.g. What courses does ZAIO offer?",
              "requiredField": true
            }
          ]
        },
        "responseMode": "lastNode",
        "options": {
          "buttonLabel": "Ask"
        }
      },
      "id": "25e460ad-7a5b-4b62-a76b-5ca7561f938b",
      "name": "Student asks a question",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.formTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 2.3,
      "position": [
        0,
        200
      ],
      "webhookId": "ce4cd433-9580-42d2-af9b-3703d0bd1895"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "assignments": {
          "assignments": [
            {
              "id": "a0e808d8-42fa-47ae-a6af-653c77029223",
              "name": "apiUrl",
              "value": "http://host.docker.internal:8000",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "5963f571-8f72-4057-9560-4a2fbc75d369",
              "name": "discordWebhookUrl",
              "value": "",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "4ab6f16b-8a48-4d5a-a2f1-faebad6caa3c",
              "name": "question",
              "value": "={{ $json.Question.trim() }}",
              "type": "string"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "e8486750-8ccc-46d1-8112-8b25eb441bfe",
      "name": "Settings",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "typeVersion": 3.4,
      "position": [
        260,
        200
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "={{ $json.apiUrl }}/ask",
        "sendBody": true,
        "specifyBody": "json",
        "jsonBody": "={{ JSON.stringify({ question: $json.question }) }}",
        "options": {
          "timeout": 300000,
          "response": {
            "response": {
              "fullResponse": true,
              "neverError": true
            }
          }
        }
      },
      "id": "719f6056-0943-48b4-baf7-aec4795678f0",
      "name": "Ask the RAG API",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [
        680,
        200
      ],
      "onError": "continueRegularOutput"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "mode": "runOnceForEachItem",
        "jsCode": "// The HTTP node never throws: it returns HTTP errors as normal items\n// (\"never error\") and a failed connection as an item with an \"error\" field\n// (\"continue on fail\"). So every outcome ends up here, and this node sorts\n// them into one of three.\nconst question = $('Settings').item.json.question;\nconst body = $json.body ?? {};\n\nif ($json.statusCode === 200 && body.source) {\n  return { json: { outcome: 'answered', question, answer: body.answer, source: body.source } };\n}\nif ($json.statusCode === 200) {\n  // source is null: neither the handbook nor the website had the answer\n  return { json: { outcome: 'not found', question, answer: body.answer } };\n}\nconst reason = body.error ?? $json.error?.message ?? 'no response from the API';\nreturn { json: { outcome: 'error', question, reason } };\n"
      },
      "id": "e6fe19b1-276f-4c85-b2ed-343e788c13df",
      "name": "Read the reply",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        900,
        200
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "rules": {
          "values": [
            {
              "conditions": {
                "options": {
                  "caseSensitive": true,
                  "leftValue": "",
                  "typeValidation": "strict",
                  "version": 2
                },
                "conditions": [
                  {
                    "id": "7476b4c8-e76c-4f34-aa11-e9a622c39ac3",
                    "leftValue": "={{ $json.outcome }}",
                    "rightValue": "answered",
                    "operator": {
                      "type": "string",
                      "operation": "equals"
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "combinator": "and"
              },
              "renameOutput": true,
              "outputKey": "answered"
            },
            {
              "conditions": {
                "options": {
                  "caseSensitive": true,
                  "leftValue": "",
                  "typeValidation": "strict",
                  "version": 2
                },
                "conditions": [
                  {
                    "id": "78a254bc-b3b4-4541-b74c-6011b1fa45c9",
                    "leftValue": "={{ $json.outcome }}",
                    "rightValue": "not found",
                    "operator": {
                      "type": "string",
                      "operation": "equals"
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "combinator": "and"
              },
              "renameOutput": true,
              "outputKey": "not found"
            },
            {
              "conditions": {
                "options": {
                  "caseSensitive": true,
                  "leftValue": "",
                  "typeValidation": "strict",
                  "version": 2
                },
                "conditions": [
                  {
                    "id": "26c872c0-39da-4b2d-87b2-219b41790250",
                    "leftValue": "={{ $json.outcome }}",
                    "rightValue": "error",
                    "operator": {
                      "type": "string",
                      "operation": "equals"
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "combinator": "and"
              },
              "renameOutput": true,
              "outputKey": "error"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "a5c97c09-bde1-4c34-9e56-24ae6b5ca193",
      "name": "What came back?",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.switch",
      "typeVersion": 3.2,
      "position": [
        1260,
        200
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "operation": "completion",
        "completionTitle": "Here's what I found",
        "completionMessage": "={{ $json.answer }}\n\nSource: {{ $json.source }}",
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "abe5d213-1539-4c80-8fdc-45210112bf9c",
      "name": "Show the answer",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.form",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        1880,
        0
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "conditions": {
          "options": {
